msgid "Known reasons for paused settings are shared across the rule overview, handover and Site Health. Support diagnostics use a reviewed allowlist: custom text, personal assignments and custom role or content-type names are omitted; lists disclose counts only. Storage diagnosis distinguishes no measurement, an incomplete measurement and an unavailable result."
